
Dianoia - An Argument Clinic

* Developing theses and counter-theses
* Assists user in development of arguments
* Participates in user's dialectic
* Formalizes arguments into mathematical logic
* Identifies strengths and weakness in arguments

  In Platonic epistemology, dianoia is discursive reasoning — the analytical,   
  step-by-step working through of an argument. That's what the server does.
  Noesis is direct intellectual intuition — the immediate grasp of the whole.   
  That's closer to what a user interface affords: seeing the argument as a
  unified thing.

